    <string name="critical_alarm_delivery_section">Critical delivery</string>
    <string name="critical_alarm_delivery_intro">Android can be configured for maximum reliability, but no app can guarantee sound when the system, notification-channel settings, revoked permissions, Total Silence, or hardware blocks it. For a critical alert, Juggluco temporarily raises the alarm stream to an audible level and restores your previous level after acknowledgement. These checks never replace checking your glucose.</string>
